"using Mission Planner <common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-"
"planner>`."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 支持通过简单的图形界面配置无线电。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`通过 Mission Planner 配置数传电台 "
"<common-configuring-a-telemetry-radio-using-mission-planner>`。"

